Package: latchverify
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), libstdc++6, libgcc-s1
Recommends: git
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Homepage: https://github.com/vinayakkam/LatchVerify
Description: capability-diffing security proxy for MCP servers
 LatchVerify pins Model Context Protocol tool definitions in latch.lock and
 blocks tools/call when a tool gains capabilities without review.
 .
 Installing it links Claude Code for the installing user: their MCP servers
 start behind the latch proxy and their tools are pinned in a per-user
 latch.lock. Set LATCH_SKIP_SETUP=1 to skip that, or run `latch setup` later.
 Includes its own Node.js runtime and a desktop launcher for the review UI.
